    kind: work_item  # 8c6b
    title: "Django ORM instance write through the model lineage: super().save() is the write chokepoint (61 pretix sites), the transitive model base, and the typed-receiver re-key (~105)"  # 8c6b
    status: todo_hard  # 8c6b
    priority: 2  # 8c6b
    parent:  # 8c6b
    tags:  # 8c6b
    - taint  # 8c6b
